    ],
    "name": "Bias correction of numerical prediction model temperature forecast",
    "headline": " It contains fourteen numerical weather prediction (NWP)'s meteorological forecast data, two in-situ observations, and five geographical auxiliary variables over Seoul, South Korea in the summer.",
